The program forms a list of families and the composition of the family. It is designed to store family history and build a family tree. Saves photos and video documents. The tree is built on graphic and hypertext canvas.
Functions of the program:
- compiling a list of families;
- drawing up a list of persons in families;
- family description and biography of people;
- construction of a genealogical tree (2D, 3D);
- construction of the genealogical branch (2D, 3D);
- construction of the ring genealogical table;
- compilation of the list of generations;
- drawing calendar family of events;
- compilation of the genealogy of the family book;
- compilation of family and personal photo albums;
- compilation of family and personal video archives;
- stores phenotype and DNA data of persons
- export / import of data into the archive;
- Export / import GEDCOM.
